    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [x] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [x] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n- [x] I have updated 'mini.nvim' to latest version of the `main` branch\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.completion\n\n### Neovim version\n\nNVIM v0.11.0-dev-1936+g5ee62906a3\n\n### Description\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a0814fa2-56b3-401f-95e0-4db1fbafe592)\n\n### Reproduction\n\ninit.lua:\n```lua\n-- Clone latest 'mini.nvim' (requires Git CLI installed)\nvim.cmd 'echo \"Installing `mini.nvim`\" | redraw'\nlocal mini_path = vim.fn.stdpath \"data\" .. \"/site/pack/deps/start/mini.nvim\"\nlocal clone_cmd = { \"git\", \"clone\", \"--depth=1\", \"https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim\", mini_path }\nvim.fn.system(clone_cmd)\nvim.cmd 'echo \"`mini.nvim` is installed\" | redraw'\n\n-- Make sure 'mini.nvim' is available\nvim.cmd \"packadd mini.nvim\"\nrequire(\"mini.deps\").setup()\n\nrequire(\"mini.completion\").setup()\nMiniDeps.add(\"neovim/nvim-lspconfig\")\nrequire(\"lspconfig\").lua_ls.setup{\n\tsettings = {\n\t\tLua = {\n\t\t\ttelemetry = {\n\t\t\t\tenable = false,\n\t\t\t},\n\t\t\tworkspace = {\n\t\t\t\tcheckThirdParty = false,\n\t\t\t\tlibrary = {\n\t\t\t\t\t\"${3rd}/luv/library\",\n\t\t\t\t\t---@diagnostic disable-next-line: deprecated\n\t\t\t\t\tunpack(vim.api.nvim_get_runtime_file(\"\", true)),\n\t\t\t\t},\n\t\t\t},\n\t\t},\n\t}\n}\n```\n\n1. open a lua file and type a function like `vim.keymap.set(`\n2. see completion window overlaps signature window",
