            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> [@echasnovski](https://github.com/echasnovski) I usually manually trigger signature help, is there a way to hide mini.completion menu?\n\nIf by \"'mini.completion' menu\" you mean the one with completion item suggestions, then it is `<C-e>` (see `:h complete_CTRL-E`).\n\nIf by \"'mini.completion' menu\" you mean signature help, then not really. See #1651.",
